            <div xml:id="d219">

                <pb facs="0292" n="220" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg220"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 19446/1.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-04-13"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 13, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 251.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that on March 5,
                    1909, the National Assembly approved and the President ratified a treaty with
                    Great Britain providing for the settlement by arbitration of differences of a
                    legal nature or those relating to the interpretation of treaties between
                    Colombia and Great Britain. Copies of the Spanish and English texts are
                    inclosed.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. C. Dawson.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d219-a1.xml" xpointer="d219-a1"/>
            </div>
